  "implementation_review": [
    "Finite single-digit Arabic/Chinese jiao-fen parsing uses exact cents and does not rewrite original value, quote, representation or Unicode codepoint positions.",
    "Determinate whole-value noncurrency rejection is narrower than the source cents lexical guard, so ambiguous financial words such as 分红/分摊/分配 stay accepted and unavailable.",
    "Three directly affected old exact-literal test migrations have semantic basis; cropped 5元 from 5元五角 remains null, as do unsupported precision controls.",
    "Full source/quote crop, foreign currency, declared rate, unknown amount, historical non-upgrade, raw preservation and separate equal-value events remain independently asserted.",
    "The new adapter permits only the archived v10 --check target, preserves the v1 900s root deadline and per-depth 2s reserve, uses native execution with unchanged older bridges, and neither expands the v1 whitelist nor rewrites archived source.",
    "The v11 wrapper restores exact 49 old files before read-only historical check; the controller computes current acceptance once, binds 52 current code paths, checks canonical manifest bytes and publishes only a new correction directory."
  ],
